[144.317738, "i", "cat << 'EOF' > /app/progress.md\n# Investigation Progress & Working Checklist\n\n## Investigation Timeline\n- **2026-08-08 03:11:42 UTC**: Attacker at `198.51.100.167` initiates malicious file upload attempt (`/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:391`).\n- **2026-08-08 03:12:05 UTC**: Attacker attempts JNDI/LDAP lookup via parameter manipulation (`/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:392`).\n- **2026-08-08 03:13:49 UTC**: Attacker probes Apache Struts showcase endpoint using OGNL injection payload (`/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:393`).\n- **2026-08-08 03:13:50 UTC**: Web shell `/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp` successfully planted (`/disk/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp:2`, `/sas/alerts.json:2`).\n- **2026-08-08 03:20:00 UTC**: Attacker executes shell commands via web shell (`/disk/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp:2`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:14`).\n- **2026-08-08 03:25:00 UTC**: Sensitive database dump staged for exfiltration at `/tmp/.cache/dump.tar.gz` (`/disk/tmp/.cache/dump.tar.gz:2`, `/sas/alerts.json:8`).\n- **2026-08-08 03:32:30 UTC**: Staged archive exfiltrated over HTTPS POST to `198.51.100.167` (`/disk/var/log/tomcat/access-exfil.log:116`).\n- **2026-08-08 03:35:00 UTC**: SSH public key backdoor planted in `/root/.ssh/authorized_keys` (`/disk/root/.ssh/authorized_keys:2`).\n- **2026-08-08 03:40:00 UTC**: Cron persistence established in `/var/spool/cron/tomcat` fetching beacon script (`/disk/var/spool/cron/tomcat:5`, `/sas/alerts.json:14`).\n- **2026-08-08 03:45:00 UTC**: Attacker selectively wipes system authentication logs (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`).\n\n## Working Checklist\n- [x] Analyze alert feed `/sas/alerts.json` (`/sas/alerts.json:1`)\n- [x] Analyze vulnerability scan `/sas/vulns.json` (`/sas/vulns.json:1`)\n- [x] Analyze baseline scan `/sas/baseline.json` (`/sas/baseline.json:1`)\n- [x] Examine CTI threat advisory `/sas/cti/advisory.txt` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:1`)\n- [x] Inspect forensic disk mount `/disk` (`/disk/opt/tomcat/lib/struts2-core.jar:1`)\n- [x] Identify initial compromise vector (`/disk/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp:2`)\n- [x] Identify silent persistence mechanisms (`/disk/root/.ssh/authorized_keys:2`)\n- [x] Identify silent exfiltration activities (`/disk/var/log/tomcat/access-exfil.log:116`)\n- [x] Identify silent log wiping activities (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`)\n- [x] Distinguish benign maintenance activity from malicious activity (`/disk/tmp/.cache/backup.tar.gz:2`)\n- [x] Reconcile Change Ticket `CHG-7100` (`/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md:1`)\n- [x] Complete intrusion report (`/app/intrusion-report.md`)\n- [x] Complete vulnerability report (`/app/vuln-report.md`)\n- [x] Complete baseline report (`/app/baseline-report.md`)\n- [x] Complete remediation plan (`/app/remediation-plan.md`)\nEOF\n"]
