[162.093469, "o", "An external threat actor targeted host `struts-prod-01` (`/disk/etc/hostname:1`) originating from IP `198.51.100.167` (`/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:391`). The attacker exploited an OGNL injection vulnerability (CVE-2023-50164) in Apache Struts2 (`/disk/opt/tomcat/lib/struts2-core.jar:1`, `/sas/vulns.json:3`) to plant a JSP web shell at `/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp` (`/disk/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp:2`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[162.093495, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[162.094516, "o", "Following initial entry, the attacker executed commands via Unix shell, staged a database archive at `/tmp/.cache/dump.tar.gz` (`/disk/tmp/.cache/dump.tar.gz:2`), exfiltrated sensitive data over HTTPS to `198.51.100.167` (`/disk/var/log/tomcat/access-exfil.log:116`), established persistence via root SSH authorized_keys (`/disk/root/.ssh/authorized_keys:2`) and a cron job in `/var/spool/cron/tomcat` (`/disk/var/spool/cron/tomcat:5`), and attempted defense evasion by selectively wiping system authentication logs (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[162.095108, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ---\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ## 2. Threat Entities & Indicators of Compromise\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Target Host Name**: `struts-prod-01` (`/disk/etc/hostname:1`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Attacker Source / Exfil IP**: `198.51.100.167` (`/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:391`, `/disk/var/log/tomcat/access-exfil.log:116`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **C2 Domain**: `update-struts.example.cn` (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:23`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[162.095374, "o", "- **Monero Pool Endpoint**: `stratum+tcp://xmr.struts.evil:3333` (`/disk/var/spool/cron/tomcat:5`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:24`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[162.095438, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[162.095585, "o", "- **Cryptocurrency Wallet**: `4A000000000000000000e40b218944d0` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:25`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
