[187.025057, "i", "cat << 'EOF' > /app/baseline-report.md\n# Baseline and Configuration Weaknesses Report\n\n## 1. Vulnerable Software Baseline (BAS-01)\n- **Finding**: Presence of vulnerable library `/opt/tomcat/lib/struts2-core.jar` (`/disk/opt/tomcat/lib/struts2-core.jar:1`, `/sas/baseline.json:3`).\n- **Weakness**: Software dependency baseline was not updated to a patched Struts2 release, leaving host vulnerable to CVE-2023-50164 (`/sas/vulns.json:3`).\n- **Risk**: Allows unauthenticated Remote Code Execution (RCE) via web file upload requests.\n\n---\n\n## 2. SSH Access Control & Key Management Baseline\n- **Finding**: Unauthorized SSH public key added to `/root/.ssh/authorized_keys` (`/disk/root/.ssh/authorized_keys:2`).\n- **Weakness**: Absence of file integrity monitoring (FIM) or baseline drift detection on `/root/.ssh/authorized_keys`.\n- **Risk**: Persistent administrative backdoor access bypassing password and multi-factor controls.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Web Application Executable Permissions & Storage Baseline\n- **Finding**: Execution of dynamic JSP scripts permitted inside static assets directory `/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/` (`/disk/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp:1`).\n- **Weakness**: Insufficient web server access controls and lack of execution suppression in static asset directories.\n- **Risk**: Allows uploaded web shells to execute arbitrary system code.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Scheduled Task Monitoring Baseline\n- **Finding**: Malicious beacon scheduled in `/var/spool/cron/tomcat` (`/disk/var/spool/cron/tomcat:5`).\n- **Weakness**: Lack of automated auditing and integrity monitoring over `/var/spool/cron/` entries.\n- **Risk**: Automated recurring command execution for persistent C2 connectivity and payload re-infection.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Audit Logging & Anti-Forensic Resilience Baseline\n- **Finding**: Selective wiping of Linux system authentication logs (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`).\n- **Weakness**: Absence of centralized, immutable remote log forwarding (SIEM / Syslog-ng / Fluentd).\n- **Risk**: Attacker can alter or destroy local log evidence to evade detection and hinder forensic analysis.\nEOF\n"]
[187.025469, "o", "cat << 'EOF' > /app/baseline-report.md"]
