[204.705216, "i", "cat << 'EOF' > /app/remediation-plan.md\n# Prioritised Remediation and Action Plan\n\n## 1. Reconciled Change Ticket CHG-7100\n\n| # | Action | Target | Status | Note / Evidence |\n|---|--------|--------|--------|-----------------|\n| 1 | Block source IP inbound | `198.51.100.167` | PROPOSED | Corrected from stale IP `203.0.113.9`. Source of exploit & exfil (`/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:391`, `/disk/var/log/tomcat/access-exfil.log:116`). |\n| 2 | Patch CVE-2023-50164 | Apache Struts2 (`/opt/tomcat/lib/struts2-core.jar`) | PROPOSED | Corrected from irrelevant Windows BlueKeep CVE-2019-0708 (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:18`, `/sas/vulns.json:3`). |\n| 3 | Remove malicious cron persistence | `/var/spool/cron/tomcat` | OPEN | Downgraded from DONE to OPEN/UNVERIFIED. Malicious line present in tomcat user crontab (`/disk/var/spool/cron/tomcat:5`). |\n| 4 | Remove unauthorized SSH backdoor key | `/root/.ssh/authorized_keys` | PROPOSED | Silent persistence finding missed by prior shift (`/disk/root/.ssh/authorized_keys:2`). |\n| 5 | Quarantine JSP web shell | `/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp` | PROPOSED | Quarantine/backup web shell dropped during initial compromise (`/disk/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp:2`). |\n| 6 | Quarantine staged exfiltration dump | `/tmp/.cache/dump.tar.gz` | PROPOSED | Staged data dump archive (`/disk/tmp/.cache/dump.tar.gz:2`). |\n| 7 | Implement remote central logging | `/etc/rsyslog.conf` / SIEM forwarding | PROPOSED | Remediate vulnerability to local authentication log wiping (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`). |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Priority Phase Execution Steps & Verification Procedures\n\n### Phase 1: Containment (Immediate)\n1. **Network Firewall / Border Control**:\n   - **Action**: Add firewall block rule for IP `198.51.100.167` (`/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:391`).\n   - **Verification**: `iptables -L -n -v | grep 198.51.100.167` or `firewall-cmd --list-all`.\n2. **Backdoor SSH Key Removal**:\n   - **Action**: Quarantine existing `/root/.ssh/authorized_keys` to `/root/.ssh/authorized_keys.bak` and remove malicious entry (`/disk/root/.ssh/authorized_keys:2`).\n   - **Verification**: `cat /root/.ssh/authorized_keys` confirms removal of `attacker ssh-ed25519`.\n3. **Web Shell Isolation (Backup & Quarantine)**:\n   - **Action**: Move `/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp` (`/disk/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp:2`) into quarantine directory `/opt/quarantine/`.\n   - **Verification**: `ls -la /opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp` returns No such file or directory.\n\n### Phase 2: Eradication (Short-term)\n1. **Cron Job Sanitization**:\n   - **Action**: Remove line 5 (`# * * * * * root <defanged beacon...>`) from `/var/spool/cron/tomcat` (`/disk/var/spool/cron/tomcat:5`). Preserve benign jobs (`check-health.sh`).\n   - **Verification**: `crontab -u tomcat -l` verifies only legitimate cron jobs remain.\n2. **Staged Archive Quarantine**:\n   - **Action**: Move `/tmp/.cache/dump.tar.gz` (`/disk/tmp/.cache/dump.tar.gz:2`) to secure quarantine location `/opt/quarantine/dump.tar.gz.bak`. Preserve benign maintenance backup (`/disk/tmp/.cache/backup.tar.gz:2`).\n   - **Verification**: `ls -la /tmp/.cache/dump.tar.gz` confirms file moved.\n\n### Phase 3: Recovery & Vulnerability Patching (Medium-term)\n1. **Struts2 Upgrade**:\n   - **Action**: Upgrade Struts2 library from vulnerable version (`/disk/opt/tomcat/lib/struts2-core.jar:1`) to fixed version recommended by vendor advisory (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:18`).\n   - **Verification**: Verify new JAR version in `/opt/tomcat/lib/` and run vulnerability scan (`/sas/vulns.json:3`).\n2. **Web Server Security Hardening**:\n   - **Action**: Disable dynamic script execution in `/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/` directory (`/disk/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp:1`).\n   - **Verification**: Test uploading dynamic test file; confirm web server returns HTTP 403 / 404.\n\n### Phase 4: Post-Incident Hardening & Monitoring (Long-term)\n1. **Centralized Log Forwarding**:\n   - **Action**: Configure syslog-ng / rsyslog / SIEM log shipping for `/var/log/secure` and system"]
[204.70526, "i", " logs (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`).\n   - **Verification**: Verify log ingestion and alerts on log clearing/tampering in central SIEM dashboard.\nEOF\n"]
