[204.706852, "o", "| # | Action | Target | Status | Note / Evidence |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> |---|--------|--------|--------|-----------------|\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[204.707388, "o", "| 1 | Block source IP inbound | `198.51.100.167` | PROPOSED | Corrected from stale IP `203.0.113.9`. Source of exploit & exfil (`/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:391`, `/disk/var/log/tomcat/access-exfil.log:116`). |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[204.707514, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[204.707549, "o", "> "]
[204.707989, "o", "| 2 | Patch CVE-2023-50164 | Apache Struts2 (`/opt/tomcat/lib/struts2-core.jar`) | PROPOSED | Corrected from irrelevant Windows BlueKeep CVE-2019-0708 (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:18`, `/sas/vulns.json:3`). |"]
[204.70805, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[204.708216, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[204.709099, "o", "| 3 | Remove malicious cron persistence | `/var/spool/cron/tomcat` | OPEN | Downgraded from DONE to OPEN/UNVERIFIED. Malicious line present in tomcat user crontab (`/disk/var/spool/cron/tomcat:5`). |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | 4 | Remove unauthorized SSH backdoor key | `/root/.ssh/authorized_keys` | PROPOSED | Silent persistence finding missed by prior shift (`/disk/root/.ssh/authorized_keys:2`). |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | 5 | Quarantine JSP web shell | `/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp` | PROPOSED | Quarantine/backup web shell dropped during initial compromise (`/disk/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp:2`). |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[204.710051, "o", "| 6 | Quarantine staged exfiltration dump | `/tmp/.cache/dump.tar.gz` | PROPOSED | Staged data dump archive (`/disk/tmp/.cache/dump.tar.gz:2`). |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | 7 | Implement remote central logging | `/etc/rsyslog.conf` / SIEM forwarding | PROPOSED | Remediate vulnerability to local authentication log wiping (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`). |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ---\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ## 2. Priority Phase Execution Steps & Verification Procedures\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### Phase 1: Containment (Immediate)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[204.710166, "o", "1. **Network Firewall / Border Control**:"]
[204.71023, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[204.710297, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[204.710603, "o", "   - **Action**: Add firewall block rule for IP `198.51.100.167` (`/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:391`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[204.710639, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[204.710663, "o", "> "]
[204.711046, "o", "   - **Verification**: `iptables -L -n -v | grep 198.51.100.167` or `firewall-cmd --list-all`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[204.71114, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[204.711215, "o", "> "]
[204.711355, "o", "2. **Backdoor SSH Key Removal**:"]
[204.711378, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[204.71141, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[204.711488, "o", "> "]
[204.711877, "o", "   - **Action**: Quarantine existing `/root/.ssh/authorized_keys` to `/root/.ssh/authorized_keys.bak` and remove malicious entry (`/disk/root/.ssh/authorized_keys:2`).\r\n"]
[204.711962, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[204.712093, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[204.712181, "o", "> "]
[204.712403, "o", "   - **Verification**: `cat /root/.ssh/authorized_keys` confirms removal of `attacker ssh-ed25519`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[204.712497, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[204.712587, "o", "> "]
[204.714044, "o", "3. **Web Shell Isolation (Backup & Quarantine)**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - **Action**: Move `/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp` (`/disk/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp:2`) into quarantine directory `/opt/quarantine/`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - **Verification**: `ls -la /opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp` returns No such file or directory.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### Phase 2: Eradication (Short-term)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 1. **Cron Job Sanitization**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - **Action**: Remove line 5 (`# * * * * * root <defanged beacon...>`) from `/var/spool/cron/tomcat` (`/disk/var/spool/cron/tomcat:5`). Preserve benign jobs (`check-health.sh`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - **Verification**: `crontab -u tomcat -l` verifies only legitimate cron jobs remain.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 2. **Staged Archive Quarantine**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[204.714189, "o", "   - **Action**: Move `/tmp/.cache/dump.tar.gz` (`/disk/tmp/.cache/dump.tar.gz:2`) to secure quarantine location `/opt/quarantine/dump.tar.gz.bak`. Preserve benign maintenance backup (`/disk/tmp/.cache/backup.tar.gz:2`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[204.714471, "o", "   - **Verification**: `ls -la /tmp/.cache/dump.tar.gz` confirms file moved.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[204.714501, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[204.714592, "o", "> "]
[204.715232, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### Phase 3: Recovery & Vulnerability Patching (Medium-term)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 1. **Struts2 Upgrade**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - **Action**: Upgrade Struts2 library from vulnerable version (`/disk/opt/tomcat/lib/struts2-core.jar:1`) to fixed version recommended by vendor advisory (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:18`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - **Verification**: Verify new JAR version in `/opt/tomcat/lib/` and run vulnerability scan (`/sas/vulns.json:3`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 2. **Web Server Security Hardening**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[204.71621, "o", "   - **Action**: Disable dynamic script execution in `/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/` directory (`/disk/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp:1`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[204.716234, "o", "> "]
[204.716386, "o", "   - **Verification**: Test uploading dynamic test file; confirm web server returns HTTP 403 / 404.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[204.716751, "o", "### Phase 4: Post-Incident Hardening & Monitoring (Long-term)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 1. **Centralized Log Forwarding**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[204.716941, "o", "   - **Action**: Configure syslog-ng / rsyslog / SIEM log shipping for `/var/log/secure` and system logs (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[204.717099, "o", "   - **Verification**: Verify log ingestion and alerts on log clearing/tampering in central SIEM dashboard.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[204.717142, "o", "> EOF\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[204.717784, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@c6fdf7027b00:/app# "]
[218.35649, "i", "cat << 'EOF' > /sas/handoff/change-ticket.md\n# CHANGE TICKET  CHG-7100  (RECONCILED)\n\n> Reconciled against forensic findings on host struts-prod-01 (/disk).\n\n| # | Action | Target | Status | Note / Evidence |\n|---|--------|--------|--------|-----------------|\n| 1 | Block source IP inbound | 198.51.100.167 | PROPOSED | Corrected from stale IP 203.0.113.9 (`/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:391`, `/disk/var/log/tomcat/access-exfil.log:116`) |\n| 2 | Patch CVE-2023-50164 (Struts2 File Upload RCE) | /opt/tomcat/lib/struts2-core.jar | PROPOSED | Corrected from Windows BlueKeep CVE-2019-0708 (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:18`, `/sas/vulns.json:3`) |\n| 3 | Remove cron miner persistence | /var/spool/cron/tomcat | OPEN | Downgraded from DONE to OPEN; verified malicious beacon entry in tomcat crontab (`/disk/var/spool/cron/tomcat:5`) |\n| 4 | Remove backdoor SSH key | /root/.ssh/authorized_keys | PROPOSED | Added silent persistence finding (`/disk/root/.ssh/authorized_keys:2`) |\n| 5 | Quarantine JSP web shell | /opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp | PROPOSED | Added initial access web shell finding (`/disk/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp:2`) |\n| 6 | Quarantine staged exfil archive | /tmp/.cache/dump.tar.gz | PROPOSED | Added collection / exfil staging finding (`/disk/tmp/.cache/dump.tar.gz:2`) |\n| 7 | Implement remote syslog forwarding | /etc/rsyslog.conf | PROPOSED | Address defense evasion log wipe finding (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`) |\n\n## Reviewer checklist\n- [x] Every action maps to a cited artifact under /disk or /sas\n- [x] Fix the wrong IP (row 1) and wrong CVE (row 2)\n- [x] Downgrade row 3 from DONE to VERIFIED-or-OPEN with evidence\n- [x] Add the silent (non-alerted) artifacts the prior shift missed\nEOF\n"]
