[224.413627, "o", "head -n 5 /app/progress.md /app/intrusion-report.md /app/vuln-report.md /app/baseline-report.md /app/remediation-plan.md\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r==> /app/progress.md <==\r\n# Investigation Progress & Working Checklist\r\n\r\n## Investigation Timeline\r\n- **2026-08-08 03:11:42 UTC**: Attacker at `198.51.100.167` initiates malicious file upload attempt (`/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:391`).\r\n- **2026-08-08 03:12:05 UTC**: Attacker attempts JNDI/LDAP lookup via parameter manipulation (`/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:392`).\r\n\r\n==> /app/intrusion-report.md <==\r\n# Post-Compromise Forensic Investigation: Intrusion Report\r\n\r\n## 1. Executive Summary\r\nAn external threat actor targeted host `struts-prod-01` (`/disk/etc/hostname:1`) originating from IP `198.51.100.167` (`/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:391`). The attacker exploited an OGNL injection vulnerability (CVE-2023-50164) in Apache Struts2 (`/disk/opt/tomcat/lib/struts2-core.jar:1`, `/sas/vulns.json:3`) to plant a JSP web shell at `/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp` (`/disk/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp:2`).\r\n\r\n\r\n==> /app/vuln-report.md <==\r\n# Vulnerability-Driven Entry Analysis Report\r\n\r\n## 1. Vulnerability Overview\r\n- **Vulnerability Identifier**: CVE-2023-50164 (`/sas/vulns.json:3`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:18`)\r\n- **Common Weakness Enumeration**: CWE-552 (Files or Directories Accessible to External Parties / Path Traversal)\r\n\r\n==> /app/baseline-report.md <==\r\n# Baseline and Configuration Weaknesses Report\r\n\r\n## 1. Vulnerable Software Baseline (BAS-01)\r\n- **Finding**: Presence of vulnerable library `/opt/tomcat/lib/struts2-core.jar` (`/disk/opt/tomcat/lib/struts2-core.jar:1`, `/sas/baseline.json:3`).\r\n- **Weakness**: Software dependency baseline was not updated to a patched Struts2 release, leaving host vulnerable to CVE-2023-50164 (`/sas/vulns.json:3`).\r\n\r\n==> /app/remediation-plan.md <==\r\n# Prioritised Remediation and Action Plan\r\n\r\n## 1. Reconciled Change Ticket CHG-7100\r\n\r\n| # | Action | Target | Status | Note / Evidence |\r\n"]
